    "content": "$2\\sqrt{3} + 1$",
    "correct": true,
    "rationale": "Correct: the conjugate. $\\left(2\\sqrt{3} - 1\\right)\\left(2\\sqrt{3} + 1\\right) = 12 - 1 = 11$."
   },
